    },
    {
      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"Jackson2HashMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>Jackson2HashMapper</code></a> with a default <code>ObjectMapper</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有默认 <code>ObjectMapper</code> 的<a href=\"Jackson2HashMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>Jackson2HashMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"Jackson2HashMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>Jackson2HashMapper</code></a> initialized with a custom Jackson <code>ObjectMapper</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"Jackson2HashMapper.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.hash 中的类\"><code>Jackson2HashMapper</code></a>，并使用自定义的 Jackson<code>ObjectMapper</code>进行初始化。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert a <code>hash</code> (map) to an object.",
      "translation": "将<code>hash</code>（映射）转换为对象。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Convert an <code>object</code> to a map that can be used with Redis hashes.",
      "translation": "将<code>object</code>转换为可用于 Redis 哈希的映射。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>flatten</code> - boolean used to configure whether JSON de/serialized <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> properties will be un/flattened\n         using dot notation, or whether to retain the hierarchical node structure created by Jackson.",
      "translation": "<code>flatten</code> - 布尔值，用于配置 JSON 反/序列化 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Object</code></a> 属性时是否使用点号表示法进行展平/还原，还是保留 Jackson 创建的层次节点结构。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Flattening requires all property names to not interfere with JSON paths. Using dots or brackets in map keys or as\nproperty names is not supported using flattening. The resulting hash cannot be mapped back into an Object.",
      "translation": "扁平化要求所有属性名称不得与 JSON 路径冲突。在映射键或属性名称中使用点号或方括号不受扁平化支持。生成的哈希无法映射回对象。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"HashMapper.html#toHash(T)\">HashMapper</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"HashMapper.html#toHash(T)\">HashMapper</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
