      "translation": "自 4.0 版本起，改用<a href=\"JacksonHashMapper.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>JacksonHashMapper</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"HashMapper.html#toHash(T)\">toHash</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\">HashMapper</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">String</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"HashMapper.html#toHash(T)\">toHash</a></code> 接口 <code><a href=\"HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\">HashMapper</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">String</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;</code> 中的方法",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"HashMapper.html#fromHash(java.util.Map)\">fromHash</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\">HashMapper</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">String</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;</code>",
      "translation": "接口 <code><a href=\"HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\">HashMapper</a>&lt;<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">String</a>,<wbr/><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Object</a>&gt;</code> 中的 <code><a href=\"HashMapper.html#fromHash(java.util.Map)\">fromHash</a></code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mapper</code> - Jackson <code>ObjectMapper</code> used to de/serialize hashed <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>objects</code></a>; must not be\n         null.",
      "translation": "<code>mapper</code> - 用于反序列化哈希化<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>对象</code></a>的 Jackson <code>ObjectMapper</code>；不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Christoph Strobl, Mark Paluch, John Blum",
      "translation": "克里斯托夫·施特罗布，马克·帕卢赫，约翰·布鲁姆",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ObjectMapper</code> based <a href=\"HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>HashMapper</code></a> implementation that allows flattening. Given an entity <code>Person</code>\nwith an <code>Address</code> like below the flattening will create individual hash entries for all nested properties and\nresolve complex types into simple types, as far as possible.",
      "translation": "基于 <code>ObjectMapper</code> 的 <a href=\"HashMapper.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.hash\"><code>HashMapper</code></a> 实现，支持扁平化操作。给定一个包含如下 <code>Address</code> 属性的实体 <code>Person</code>，扁平化过程将为所有嵌套属性创建独立的哈希条目，并在可能的情况下将复杂类型解析为简单类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<h3 id=\"example-heading\">Example</h3><pre class=\"code\">class Person {\n        String firstname;\n        String lastname;\n        Address address;\n        Date date;\n        LocalDateTime localDateTime;\n}\n\nclass Address {\n        String city;\n        String country;\n}\n</pre><h3 id=\"normal-heading\">Normal</h3>",
      "translation": "<h3 id=\"example-heading\">示例</h3><pre class=\"code\">class Person {\n    String firstname;\n    String lastname;\n    Address address;\n    Date date;\n    LocalDateTime localDateTime;\n}\n\nclass Address {\n    String city;\n    String country;\n}\n</pre><h3 id=\"normal-heading\">普通</h3>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<h3 id=\"flat-heading\">Flat</h3>",
      "translation": "<h3 id=\"flat-heading\">扁平化</h3>",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
